<p>Your cunning manipulations allow you to use charms (wands, totems and torques) more efficiently, reducing their cooldowns and the power cost of all usable items by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">15%, 24%, 30%, 35%, 39%.</acronym></p><p>In addition your knowledge of devices allows you to disarm known traps (<acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Cunning 100">44, 61, 73, 82, 90</acronym> disarm 'power', improves with Cunning).</p>